message: "If you use SimulSI in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "SimulSI: Simulation Intelligence"
abstract: >-
  A general-purpose, reproducible discrete-event simulation and experimentation
  framework for Python: models, replications with common random numbers,
  statistics, scenario comparison, sensitivity analysis, optimisation and a
  local web dashboard.
